1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,057
FieldRelay stopped.

2
00:00:02,058 --> 00:00:07,324
It raised this itself, and it says why: the vendor quoted a price.

3
00:00:07,325 --> 00:00:11,604
CALL-E can find out that a job costs thirty-five dollars.

4
00:00:11,605 --> 00:00:14,426
Only a person can agree to pay it.

5
00:00:14,427 --> 00:00:17,832
That decision is recorded against my name.

6
00:00:17,833 --> 00:00:27,513
And if the vendor's answer had changed since this was raised, the system would have refused my approval, because I'd be agreeing to something I never read.

